# ── Dev mode: no manual IP configuration needed ────────────────────────────────
# When running `npx expo start`, the app auto-detects the host machine's LAN IP
# from Expo's Metro server URI. All three service URLs are derived automatically.
# You do NOT need to edit this file for local development.
#
# ── Production / standalone builds ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment and set EXPO_PUBLIC_PROD_HOST to override the default EC2 address,
# or set individual service URLs below.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_PROD_HOST=3.26.11.128

# EXPO_PUBLIC_WALTID_WALLET_URL=http://<host>:7001
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ISSUER_API_URL=http://<host>:4000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ISSUER_BASE_URL=http://<host>
